  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: Top Clean International specializes in&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"207\" data-start=\"168\">heavy-duty industrial hand cleaners</strong> designed for mechanics, construction workers, and industrial professionals. Our products effectively remove <strong data-end=\"366\" data-start=\"316\">grease, oil, tar, adhesives, resins, and paint</strong> while being <strong data-end=\"401\" data-start=\"379\">gentle on the skin</strong>. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description: Our <strong data-end=\"476\" data-start=\"448\">industrial hand cleaners</strong> are formulated to tackle <strong data-end=\"524\" data-start=\"502\">the toughest grime</strong> without harsh chemicals. They are:<br data-end=\"562\" data-start=\"559\">✔ <strong data-end=\"579\" data-start=\"564\">Fast-acting</strong> &ndash; Removes stubborn grease and dirt in seconds.<br data-end=\"629\" data-start=\"626\">✔ <strong data-end=\"648\" data-start=\"631\">Skin-friendly</strong> &ndash; No harsh irritants or drying agents.<br data-end=\"690\" data-start=\"687\">✔ <strong data-end=\"709\" data-start=\"692\">Eco-conscious</strong> &ndash; Uses biodegradable ingredients.<br data-end=\"746\" data-start=\"743\">✔ <strong data-end=\"761\" data-start=\"748\">Versatile</strong> &ndash; Suitable for mechanics, construction workers, painters, and industrial professionals.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"972\" data-start=\"898\"><strong data-end=\"927\" data-start=\"900\">Superior Cleaning Power</strong> &ndash; Works on the toughest industrial messes.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1041\" data-start=\"973\"><strong data-end=\"994\" data-start=\"975\">Gentle on Hands</strong> &ndash; Protects skin from dryness and irritation.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1042\"><strong data-end=\"1068\" data-start=\"1044\">Eco-Friendly Formula</strong> &ndash; Safe for both users and the environment.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1201\" data-start=\"1114\"><strong data-end=\"1144\" data-start=\"1116\">Trusted by Professionals</strong> &ndash; Used in workshops, garages, and factories worldwide.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms: Paypal</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Other information:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"1565\" data-start=\"1443\"><strong data-end=\"1467\" data-start=\"1445\">Affiliate Support:</strong> We provide <strong data-end=\"1542\" data-start=\"1479\">banners, product images, promo codes, and marketing content</strong> to help you succeed.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1666\" data-start=\"1566\"><strong data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1568\">Free Samples Available:</strong> Serious affiliates can request <strong data-end=\"1651\" data-start=\"1627\">free product samples</strong> for reviews.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1760\" data-start=\"1667\"><strong data-end=\"1694\" data-start=\"1669\">Exclusive Promotions:</strong> Affiliates get <strong data-end=\"1736\" data-start=\"1710\">special discount codes</strong> to boost conversions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>",
